	.string "All Trainers in this Gym use\nNormal-type Pokémon.\pThis is just between you and me...\pNormal-type Pokémon are weak against\nFighting-type Pokémon.\pAround here, Fighting-type Pokémon\nshow up around Pinwheel Forest.\pNow, I will explain about the Gym itself!\pIn this Pokémon Gym, if you answer\nquestions hidden in books,\l\lyou can move forward.\pFor your information, the first book is\n“Nice to Meet You, Pokémon.“\pIf you don't know where the book is,\nplease ask anyone!$"

